es, suppressed in the wake of her mother's death, begin to float to the top of her consciousness. Can it be that she has met Noel before? And how does this connect with the appearance of the saucer itself? To solve the riddle, Nonoka must join with her friends and rediscover the events that occurred before she left Lake Kiriya.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Tragedy","rank":100,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":68,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":65,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Twins","rank":45,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Celestial Method","english":"Celestial Method","native":"天体のメソッド","romaji":"Sora no Method","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"天体的秩序"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"天体运行式"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"天体的方式"}]},"trailer":{"id":"G4ybgMqAHiU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G4ybgMqAHiU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}